body:
{first_name} — good to meet you at {event_name}. {specific_callback_to_the_conversation}

You mentioned {their_specific_point}. I pulled the relevant section of the DFW {vertical} register — attaching it here in case it's useful.

If it's worth a longer conversation I'm around most of {timeframe}. And if the timing isn't right, no problem at all.

{first_name} — a specific ask, and please say no freely if it isn't a fit.

I've been trying to reach {target_name} at {target_firm}. {one_line_why_relevant}

If you know them well enough to make an introduction, I'd be grateful. If it's easier, I'm glad to send you something forwardable so you're not writing it yourself.
